'''Heat''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Rainbow Box]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
It resembles a black dragon breathing a large orange flame. The guard represents the dragon’s head, and the handle is solid black with an orange paracord design over it. Attached to the bottom of the handle is the orange pointed flame pommel. 

==Trivia. ==
* It was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]] in the early stages of [[Murder Mystery 2]], but was soon replaced by the [[Chroma Box]] due to copyright reasons. However, the [[Chroma Box]] was renamed to the [[Rainbow Box]] in August of 2016. This and [[Shiny]] are the only Items that weren't deleted when the [[Chroma Box]] was replaced and this is the only item that was not deleted from the game when the [[MLG Box]] was replaced.
* This, [[Tides]], and [[Seer]] were used to craft [[Flames]] in the crafting station before [[Season 1]] came out on May 25, 2019.
*When a player salvaged this knife before the [[Season 1]] update, it provided a [[Fire Orb]]. This was also the material used to craft Flames. 
* This and 100 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] were used to craft [[Chill]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/105351545/Dragons-Blaze-Sword Dragon's Blaze Sword].
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 55 godly [[shards]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Heat]], which can be found in the same box. 

